  "body": "The spec [says](https://fetch.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-request-destination) that the default value of `destination` is the empty string, but never defines explicitly what should happen if it is in fact the empty string. The closest I can find is the exemplar table that comes a couple of paragraphs later, and it does not clearly explain what the meaning of `\"\"` is for `destination`.",
